    <sectiondef kind="define">
      <memberdef kind="define" id="gpu__cuda__error__hardening_8h_1abb666f07c45dfaab7e7397afa59ab249" prot="public" static="no">
        <name>CHECKED_CUDA_WITH_FALLBACK</name>
        <param><defname>stmt</defname></param>
        <param><defname>fallback_block</defname></param>
        <initializer>(stmt)</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>CUDA error checking with fallback block execution. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Executes stmt. On CUDA error:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Maps error to GPUDispatchErrorCode</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Emits diagnostic</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Executes fallback_block</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">bool<sp/>gpu_success<sp/>=<sp/>false;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">CHECKED_CUDA_WITH_FALLBACK(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>cudaMalloc(&amp;ptr,<sp/>size),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>gpu_success<sp/>=<sp/>false;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>implement<sp/>CPU<sp/>fallback<sp/>here</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">if<sp/>(gpu_success)<sp/>{<sp/>//<sp/>use<sp/>GPU<sp/>result<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
